    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own path, set up turrets, craft and automate to keep your defenses up, and adapt your strategy as enemies evolve. Play solo or team up with fellow Tinkerbots for chaotic co-op action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtester's Hall of Fame </strong>(Game end-screen)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480340/extras/1e8b709f23c97558fad4b66b5b89d2ec.avif?t=1754473968\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480340/extras/2717b203cdfe0dc5e9a0c57d07867241.avif?t=1754473968\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Co-op</strong> \u2013 Play alone or team up with up to 4 players in local co-op <i>(Supports Steam Remote Play Together)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Preparation Phase</strong> \u2013 Set up defenses and plan your base before the battle starts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense Phase</strong> \u2013 Craft ammo, resupply turrets, keep your defenses running</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Terrain &amp; Mazing Paths</strong> \u2013 Destroy obstacles and carve your own paths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting &amp; Automation</strong> \u2013 Craft resources and automate your production lines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recipes</strong> \u2013 Unlock 15+ unique crafting recipes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perks</strong> \u2013 Unlock over 23+ perks to powerful perks to enhance your playstyles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turret Evolution System</strong> \u2013 Evolve your turrets with over 16+ turret variants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Enemies</strong> \u2013 Encounter machines that evolve through 4 distinct tiers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own path, set up turrets, craft and automate to keep your defenses up, and adapt your strategy as enemies evolve. Play solo or team up with fellow Tinkerbots for chaotic co-op action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtester's Hall of Fame </strong>(Game end-screen)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480340/extras/1e8b709f23c97558fad4b66b5b89d2ec.avif?t=1754473968\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480340/extras/2717b203cdfe0dc5e9a0c57d07867241.avif?t=1754473968\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Co-op</strong> \u2013 Play alone or team up with up to 4 players in local co-op <i>(Supports Steam Remote Play Together)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Preparation Phase</strong> \u2013 Set up defenses and plan your base before the battle starts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defense Phase</strong> \u2013 Craft ammo, resupply turrets, keep your defenses running</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Terrain &amp; Mazing Paths</strong> \u2013 Destroy obstacles and carve your own paths</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting &amp; Automation</strong> \u2013 Craft resources and automate your production lines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recipes</strong> \u2013 Unlock 15+ unique crafting recipes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perks</strong> \u2013 Unlock over 23+ perks to powerful perks to enhance your playstyles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turret Evolution System</strong> \u2013 Evolve your turrets with over 16+ turret variants</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Enemies</strong> \u2013 Encounter machines that evolve through 4 distinct tiers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
